<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL-ROUND LEADERS AT TEXAS OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL-ROUND LEADERS AT TEXAS OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the</p>
<p>final round at the $1.2 million Texas Open golf tournament on</p>
<p>Sunday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>275 David Ogrin 70 65 68 72</p>
<p>276 Jay Haas 70 66 70 70</p>
<p>277 Tiger Woods 69 68 73 67</p>
<p>278 Greg Kraft 71 72 70 65, Len Mattiace 73 71 65 69</p>
<p>279 John Huston 66 71 74 68, Tim Herron 70 70 71 68, Keith</p>
<p>Fergus 70 71 68 70</p>
<p>280 Scott Dunlap 70 70 71 69, Lee Janzen 73 67 70 70</p>
<p>281 Justin Leonard 71 72 71 67, Brian Claar 69 70 71 71,</p>
<p>Corey Pavin 70 70 70 71, Brad Fabel 71 70 69 71, John Morse 68</p>
<p>71 69 73, Kelly Gibson 68 74 67 72, Tommy Armour III 71 72 64</p>
<p>74</p>
<p>282 Robert Gamez 74 68 71 69, Dan Pohl 72 71 70 69, J.L.</p>
<p>Lewis 69 71 71 71, Hugh Royer 67 74 68 73</p>
